---
title: "repay_flash_loan (flash_loan.move)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_emit: emit RepayFlashLoanEvent
    q_emit --> q_get_referral: referral = app.referral_mut()
    q_get_referral --> q_repay: market.repay_flash_loan(coin, loan, referral, none(), ctx)
    q_repay --> [*]: loan consumed

    note right of q_version
        INV-001: Version must match current protocol version
    end note

    note right of q_emit
        INV-002: Event amount = coin.value() (total repay amount including fee)
        INV-003: Event fee = loan.fee() (fee recorded at borrow time)
    end note

    note right of q_repay
        INV-004: FlashLoan hot potato is consumed, enforcing atomic borrow-repay
        INV-005: coin.value() must be >= loan.loan_amount() + loan.fee()
        INV-006: Referral code is none() - no referral tracking in simple repay
    end note
